{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__stent#card-zh","repo":"omdsh-dev/stent","commit":"af701b3b1989066f5638e83a56413c58becb5d26","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Stent 是面向 DSH/Cordis 插件作者的可选运行时扩展层，支持 Node 和浏览器函数补丁。插件可按模块、文件和函数注册 before、after、around、replace handler；补丁可启停，并随 Cordis 生命周期清理。DSH 集成另提供工具与执行监听、用户命令、系统提示词和动态上下文注册，以及 Agent 事件监听和日志化消息注入。bundle 默认关闭，需显式启用 stent-dsh；普通 DSH 启动不会挂载。适合需要扩展其他插件行为或接入 DSH 宿主 API 的开发者。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/stent/src/service.ts:2-12","packages/stent/src/transform/transform.ts:2-11","packages/stent-dsh/src/index.ts:2-11","cordis.patch.yml:1-6"]}
{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__stent#card-en","repo":"omdsh-dev/stent","commit":"af701b3b1989066f5638e83a56413c58becb5d26","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Stent adds opt-in function patching for DSH/Cordis plugins. Register before, after, around, or replace handlers for selected functions; handlers follow plugin lifecycle. The DSH package also exposes tools, commands, prompts, context, and Agent events. Enable the disabled bundle through stent-dsh.","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/stent/src/service.ts:2-12","packages/stent/src/transform/transform.ts:2-11","packages/stent-dsh/src/index.ts:2-11","cordis.patch.yml:1-6"]}
